{#- Unavailable batch page (W03). Purpose: what a buyer sees when a scanned code has no live page:
    not yet published, withdrawn, or unknown. Carries no batch data, only the code (if given).
    Requirements: W03 "unpublished/404 variant"; FR15 (page served from storage, so the builder or the
    CDN serves this file); User Flows §Design rules (Tamil first); CLAUDE.md §6 (nothing personal).
    Caller: agritrace_page.render.render_unavailable, with code (str | None) and reason. -#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>{{ plain("unavailable.title") }}</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:,">
<style>{% include "page.css" %}</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<section>
<h1>{{ t("unavailable.title") }}</h1>
<p>{{ t("unavailable." ~ reason) }}</p>
{% if code %}<p>{{ t("batch_code") }}: <strong>{{ code }}</strong></p>
{% endif %}
</section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
